# Internationalisation (i18n)

## Rules
- ALL user-facing strings use i18n. No hardcoded English strings in JSX or TS.
- ALL user-facing numbers, dates, and durations use locale-aware components.
- Write English first. AI translates the rest via `pnpm run i18n:translate`.

## Frontend — next-intl
Translation files at `apps/web/messages/<lang>/<module>.json`.

```typescript
const t = useTranslations('incidents');
t('filters.status.open')   // → "Open"
```

